{"path":"utility/variant/visit","title":"std::variant<Types...>::visit","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::variant&lt;Types...&gt;::</span>visit","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/variant/visit","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Applies the visitor vis (a Callable that can be called with any combination of types from the variant) to the variant held by self.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Self, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Visitor <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> visit<span class=\"br0\">(</span> this Self<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> self, Visitor<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> vis <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> R, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Self, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Visitor <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> R visit<span class=\"br0\">(</span> this Self<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> self, Visitor<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> vis <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Applies the visitor <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">vis</span></code> (a <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Callable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Callable</em></a> that can be called with any combination of types from the variant) to the variant held by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">self</span></code>.\n</p><p>Given type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">V</span></code> as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward_like\"><span class=\"kw3645\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward_like</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Self<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/declval\"><span class=\"kw1127\">std::<span class=\"me2\">declval</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>variant<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, the equivalent call is:\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">visit</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1124\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Visitor<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>vis<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"br0\">(</span>V<span class=\"br0\">)</span> self<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">visit</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1124\